display resize 2400 1800
display projection Orthographic
display depthcue off
axes location Off
color Display Background white
mol new test.xyz type xyz waitfor all
mol modstyle 0 top CPK 0.8 0.25 24 24
mol modcolor 0 top Element
puts "VMD_SIZE [display get size]"
render TachyonInternal test.tga
quit
